      "content": "negotiation or counseling... that sounds like a joke. what am i supposed to do, tell them i can't pay? they'll just come after me more. it's not just \"stressful,\" it's like a life sentence. i look at my life and i see nothing but a giant debt pile that's gonna outlive me. it feels like the only way the noise actually stops is if i just... stop. if i'm just not here to deal with it anymore.",
